sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant R as Recruiter
    participant W as web /admin/match
    participant A as api admin router
    participant X as Ingest
    participant L as LLM
    participant E as FastEmbed
    participant DB as Postgres
    participant F as Files

    R->>W: upload PDF, DOCX or TXT (max 10 MB)
    W->>A: POST /admin/resumes (session cookie)
    A->>A: SHA-256 of bytes
    alt hash already stored
        A-->>W: already ingested (link to profile)
    else new file
        A->>X: extract text
        alt unsupported, .doc, no text layer, or password-protected
            X-->>W: clear message, nothing stored
        else text OK
            Note over X: No clearance or classification check.<br/>"TOP SECRET" and "TS/SCI" are normal résumé text.
            X->>X: redact SSNs
            A->>F: store original privately
            A->>L: redacted text, ask for a JSON profile
            L-->>A: name, email, phone, city, skills, titles, clearance, polygraph, citizenship, summary
            A->>A: validate JSON, map clearance and polygraph to levels
            A->>DB: candidate status pending_review
            A-->>W: review screen
            R->>W: edit fields, then Confirm (or Delete)
            W->>A: POST /admin/resumes/{id}/confirm
            A->>E: candidate vector (1,024 cap) + 512-token chunks, 64 overlap
            A->>DB: save vectors and confirmed profile
            A->>A: rank_jobs - skill score, semantic, final, confidence, clearance flag
            A->>DB: save matches
            A->>L: optional 2-4 sentence explanation from quotes only
            A-->>W: ranked jobs with score parts and quotes
        end
    end
